spec PushDelivery.tla
check INVARIANTS ExpiryGate RetryOnlyBeforeDeadline PreserveOtherReminder GoneClosesDevice NoRequeueAfterCommit
reach DuplicateAfterCrash | timing
reach ReadyRetryKeepsLeave | timing
reach ExactRetryCutoff | timing
reach ExpiredSkip | timing
reach ExpiredDuringKeyLookup | timing
reach Coalesced | timing
reach PastReadySkipped | timing
run timing boundaries |
